-- Typechecks cleanly; neither #ASSERT can be decided. A bare unsupplied BOOLEAN
-- is neither TRUE nor FALSE: `#ASSERT NOT b` forces b and RAISES (stuck on an
-- assumed term), while `#ASSERT b` reduces to the symbolic b WITHOUT raising.
-- Both must report the same undecided outcome.
§ `An undecidable assertion`
    GIVEN b IS A BOOLEAN
#ASSERT b
#ASSERT NOT b
